WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.632 --> 00:00:10.752
Some wedding parents want a simple, understated style, while others prefer something bold and distinctive.

2
00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:15.552
Being a wedding parent doesn't mean you have to go plain.

3
00:00:15.888 --> 00:00:22.560
In that case, it's important to talk it through with your artist in a detailed pre-consultation.

4
00:00:22.896 --> 00:00:27.216
Rather than an overly natural, plain look, consider makeup and attire that reflect your personality,

5
00:00:27.552 --> 00:00:34.104
and ask the artist how to style specific elements for a bolder image instead of a demure one.

6
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.424
A few small changes can go a long way toward expressing your individuality.

7
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.488
That said, "bold" here still means staying within the bounds of a wedding parent's dignity.

8
00:00:43.824 --> 00:00:51.816
In other words, choosing a demure or bold image while keeping that dignity leads to more successful wedding-parent makeup.

9
00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:55.776
Your wish to express your own style will always be respected.
